            "components": {
              "canonical_alphabet": "SymbolObservation preserves full ordered form/held-label pair identity, nonempty/distinct carrier guard, original nonempty fields and guard/error order, without normalization.",
              "validate_observation": "Exact nonempty alphabet, equal row count, distinct source keys, source-set equality and nonempty observation labels. validationMeaning/keysMeaning characterize admission; validatedLookup constructs exactly one nonempty label for every source member.",
              "observed_label": "Exactly one matching full-pair source row is required; zero or duplicate matches retain the source exception. observedExactlyOnce/observedSource/observedUnique prove singleton, source provenance and uniqueness.",
              "distinguishable": "Original self-comparison false before any lookup; otherwise ordered left/right lookup errors or exact label inequality. Native irreflexivity, symmetry and retainedIffDifferent.",
              "observation_classes": "Original validation precedes ordered label collection; first-occurrence labels and source-ordered fibres retain every microform. Collection source equality, class/fibre membership, distinct class labels, class nonemptiness, coverage and disjointness prove the partition. Reused firstLabels is the exact original dict.fromkeys order, not sorted or deduplicated source objects.",
              "distinction_ledger": "Original positional i<j pair sequence and two-pass retained/closed selections, including unvalidated input/error behavior. Membership, source endpoints, totality on valid observations, disjointness and exhaustion proved.",
              "SPEC.induction": "Singleton pair ledger is empty. successorPairOrder gives exact insertion of each new pair into its original row order; newPairIncluded/priorPairsRetained prove new/prior pair coverage. SymbolExtension appends exactly one fresh observation row, proves its unique label, preserves prior lookups/distinctions and establishes nonempty lookup on every extended alphabet member.",
              "SPEC.coarsening": "coarseningClosed and coarseningClosesExactly prove that image merging cannot reopen closed distinctions and closes a prior distinction exactly when the mapped image labels become equal.",
              "SPEC.dimensions/witnesses/controls": "Full original512 nine-axis product, exact candidate IDs/forms/reasons/order, all coordinate rejections and unique survivor; all six actual operational witnesses pass kernel proof. Original laws/induction/exclusions/control records/exposition retained.",
